bucketize_out_cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/Bucketization.cu
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    bucketize_out_cuda(
        self: Tensor[*D],
        boundaries: Tensor[N],
        out_int32: bool,
        right: bool,
        result: Tensor[*D, int|int64]
    ) -> Tensor[*D]

    约束:
    - boundaries.dim == 1

【算法】
    assert boundaries.dim == 1
    searchsorted_out_cuda(boundaries, self, out_int32, right, None, None, result)
    return result

【备注】
    - bucketize 是 searchsorted 的特化版本，强制 boundaries 为 1D

