bucketize_cuda (Tensor重载)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/Bucketization.cu
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    bucketize_cuda(
        self: Tensor[*D],
        boundaries: Tensor[N],
        out_int32: bool,
        right: bool
    ) -> Tensor[*D, int|int64]

【算法】
    scalar_type = ScalarType::Int if out_int32 else ScalarType::Long
    result = at::empty({0}, device=self.device(), dtype=scalar_type, memory_format=Contiguous)
    bucketize_out_cuda(self, boundaries, out_int32, right, result)
    return result

